# Carverse Performance — environment example
# The frontend resolves its backend base URL at runtime in this order:
#   1. ?api=<url> query param (remembered in localStorage as `cv_api`)
#   2. localStorage `cv_api`
#   3. same origin (when served over http/https)
#
# No build-time env var is required. This file documents the contract only.
# To hard-default a backend during local dev, open:
#   http://localhost:3000/?api=http://localhost:8000
